<Layout title="About">
  <Header />
  <section id = "about">
    <h1>About Me</h1>
    <p>I am Joshua Wu, but my friends usually call me <a href="https://github.com/joshie-wu">Joshie</a>. I am 
    a recent graduate of Columbia University (<b>BA Mathematics</b> and <b>MA Statistics</b>). Besides developing a love for books there
    (you should totally join my reading club if you live in New York!), I also became interested in data analysis. In particular,
    I enjoy uncovering patterns and untangling complex datasets. I believe that every <i>good</i> dataset can tell
    a story, someone just has to tinker with it a little. And why can't that someone be me?</p>
    
    <p>This website is still under work, and I haven't figured out a way to reliably add comments.
    For now, email me at <b>josh.wenjun@gmail.com</b>.</p>  
  </section>
</Layout>